%% Title: MediSearch AI Recommendation Engine Workflow
flowchart TB
  subgraph Inputs[Recommendation Inputs]
    DrugProfile[Drug Name, Category, Active Ingredients]
    UserSignals[Search History, Favorites, Clicks]
    InventorySignals[Price, Stock, Pharmacy Availability]
    WarehouseFacts[Warehouse Facts and Aggregates]
  end

  subgraph FeatureEngineering[Feature Engineering]
    Normalize[Normalize Text and Categories]
    Vectorize[Create TF-IDF / Embedding Vectors]
    Similarity[Compute Drug Similarity Scores]
    Context[Apply Availability and Price Context]
  end

  subgraph Serving[Serving Workflow]
    Request[Frontend Recommendation Request]
    Backend[Express Recommendation Endpoint]
    Ranker[Ranking and Filtering]
    Explain[Alternative Explanation]
    Response[Recommended Drugs and Alternatives]
  end

  DrugProfile --> Normalize
  UserSignals --> Context
  InventorySignals --> Context
  WarehouseFacts --> Vectorize
  Normalize --> Vectorize --> Similarity --> Ranker
  Context --> Ranker
  Request --> Backend --> Ranker --> Explain --> Response
